Because upon the conclusion of RSO training for all five campuses,

122
00:09:42,180 --> 00:09:47,180
this PowerPoint, as well as the post-test that will accompany

123
00:09:47,180 --> 00:09:50,180
this RSO training, will be sent to everyone

