00:20:53,180 --> 00:20:58,180
COA, which is short for Council on Organizational Activities.

324
00:20:58,180 --> 00:21:01,180
RSM actually stands for Recognized Student Organization,

325
00:21:01,180 --> 00:21:03,180
Student Government Association,

